[Infobox Text]
OMugen (%s - %s)

* A 64-bit, MUGEN-compatible fighting game engine based on Ikemen GO.
* You are using the built-in OMugen screenpack. The game's characters,
  stages, lifebars, sounds and music are used as they are.
* Switch screenpacks in Options > Video Settings > OMugen Screenpack.

